# Shared reference-card manifest for MNFS.
#
# Claude Code plugins give every skill its own references/ dir loaded relative to
# the skill — there is no shared-include mechanism, so cards reused verbatim across
# skills must be physically copied. This manifest names the card groups that are
# INTENDED to be byte-identical so sync-shared-references.sh can keep them in lock
# step and fail loudly on drift.
#
# Format: one group per line, space-separated paths relative to mnfs-plugin/.
# The FIRST path is the canonical source; the rest are synced consumers.
#
# Role-specialised variants (feature.md, milestone.md, milestone-validation-contract.md,
# mission-validation-contract.md) are DIVERGENT BY DESIGN and are deliberately absent.

skills/milestone-execution/references/execution-guide.md skills/feature-context-pack/references/execution-guide.md skills/feature-validation-review/references/execution-guide.md skills/mission-closeout/references/execution-guide.md
skills/feature-execution/references/feature-validation.md skills/correction-worker/references/feature-validation.md skills/feature-validation-review/references/feature-validation.md skills/milestone-execution/references/feature-validation.md skills/validation/references/feature-validation.md
skills/milestone-execution/references/blocked-report.md skills/correction-worker/references/blocked-report.md skills/feature-execution/references/blocked-report.md skills/mission-closeout/references/blocked-report.md skills/validation/references/blocked-report.md
skills/validation/references/milestone-validation-result.md skills/milestone-execution/references/milestone-validation-result.md
skills/validation/references/mission-validation-result.md skills/mission-closeout/references/mission-validation-result.md
skills/correction-worker/references/correction-task.md skills/milestone-execution/references/correction-task.md
skills/feature-execution/references/feature-spec.md skills/correction-worker/references/feature-spec.md
skills/feature-execution/references/feature-plan.md skills/correction-worker/references/feature-plan.md
